any is loss-making at the operating line (-3.4% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826600/000119312526209250/0001193125-26-209250-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-209250"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $2.0m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826600/000119312526209250/0001193125-26-209250-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-209250"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.8% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1826600/000095010326007661/0000950103-26-007661-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -6.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.06,"consecutive":2,"current":0.09,"current_display":"9.0%","threshold_display":"-6.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":0.004,"current_display":"0.4%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Share count growth above this rate transfers your stake to new holders faster than the business is likely to compound.","editable":true},{"id":"leverage_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Debt to equity rises above 1.10","metric":"debt_to_equity","comparison":"above","threshold